Output docs/demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1400
Set Height 760
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Builtin Dark"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Hide
Type "export PATH=$PWD:$PATH COLORTERM=truecolor && clear"
Enter
Show
Type "runrack --demo"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
Down
Sleep 800ms
Up
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
Escape
Sleep 1s
Type "?"
Sleep 2s
Escape
Sleep 1500ms
Screenshot docs/board.png
Type "q"
Sleep 300ms
